    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i think i have a UTI or something... it's been burning really bad for the last 2 days. i have some nitrofurantoin left over from a previous prescription, is it okay if i just take a few of those to clear it up? i have stage 3 kidney disease so i wanted to check first if thats a bad idea or what the right dose is.",
