    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm really stressed about the clinic being closed and the money part... i just need to know if there's anything else i can do instead of antibiotics if i really can't get to a doctor right now. like would taking a lot of vitamin c or some cranberry supplements help clear it out enough so i don't have to worry about it until monday? i just want to manage it myself for now.",
